{% set currentUser = craft.app.user.identity %}
{% set section = craft.app.entries.getSectionByHandle('labArticles') %}
{% set entryType = craft.app.entries.getEntryTypeByHandle('labArticle') %}

<h2>Blanket mode</h2>

<p class="hint">
	Seeded state: blanket mode on, allowlisting exactly
	<code>entries/save-entry</code> &mdash; deliberately an action no integration
	covers, because a payload verified twice trips replay protection. The form
	below posts to that action, so it needs a signed-in user with save
	permission: sign in at <a href="/admin">/admin</a> as
	<strong>admin / password</strong> first. Currently signed in:
	<strong>{{ currentUser ? currentUser.username : 'nobody' }}</strong>.
</p>

<ol class="hint">
	<li>Signed in as admin, solve the widget, submit &mdash; the entry saves.</li>
	<li>Submit without touching the widget &mdash; 400 &ldquo;Altcha verification failed&rdquo; from blanket mode, before Craft&rsquo;s controller runs.</li>
	<li>Non-allowlisted actions: every other page in this lab posts to actions <em>not</em> on the allowlist and works normally &mdash; that is the &ldquo;leaves everything else untouched&rdquo; check.</li>
	<li>Allowlist <code>*</code> in this instance&rsquo;s <code>config/altcha.php</code>, refresh the index page &mdash; the live widget still verifies, because <code>altcha/*</code> endpoints are never enforced. Revert afterwards.</li>
	<li>CP, console, GET, and live-preview requests pass through untouched &mdash; you exercise the first two constantly while using this lab.</li>
</ol>

{% if section and entryType %}
	<form method="post">
		{{ csrfInput() }}
		{{ actionInput('entries/save-entry') }}
		{{ redirectInput('lab-test?page=blanket') }}
		{{ hiddenInput('sectionId', section.id) }}
		{{ hiddenInput('typeId', entryType.id) }}

		<label for="blanket-title">Title</label>
		<input id="blanket-title" name="title" type="text" value="Blanket entry {{ random(1000, 9999) }}">

		{{ craft.altcha.renderWidget() }}

		<p><button type="submit">Save entry</button></p>
	</form>
{% else %}
	<p class="errors">No <code>labArticles</code> section found &mdash; run <code>spark lab seed</code>.</p>
{% endif %}
